                <note rend="inline" type="source">825.00/675: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Chile</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Culbertson</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Acting Secretary of
                        State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Santiago</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1931-08-06T10:00:00-05:00">August 6, 1931—10
                        a.m.</date><lb/>[Received 11:02 a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>87. Department’s telegram No. 32, August 1, noon. Presidential elections have
                    been called for October 4th.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Culbertson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
